#: site/lectures/07-array-methods.md:1588
msgid "Old style"
msgstr "Стар стил"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/07-array-methods.md:1588
msgid "`function (x) { return ...; }`, `forEach` + `push`, string comparisons of versions, boolean compare functions - read it, modernise it"
msgstr "`function (x) { return ...; }`, `forEach` + `push`, сравняване на версии като strings, функции за сравнение, връщащи boolean - четете го, модернизирайте го"

#. heading 2
#: site/lectures/07-array-methods.md:1590
msgid "Homework"
msgstr "Домашно"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-array-methods.md:1592
msgid "`07-array-methods/homework.js` (in the homework repository): outdated modules from a dictionary, sorted; a pool report from the record list; and an index for a whole set of lookups."
msgstr "`07-array-methods/homework.js` (в homework repository): остарели модули от dictionary, сортирани; отчет за pools от списъка от записи; и индекс за цял набор от търсения."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-array-methods.md:1595
msgid "The practice tasks you did not finish in class - recommended, as later tasks and the course project reuse them. Every check must print `OK`."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-array-methods.md:1597
msgid "**Course project:** create your repository (section 12) with `library.js`, `try.js` and two or three anonymised sample documents. Put in your `get`, `compareVersions`, `versionBelow` and `groupBy`, export them, and run `try.js`."
msgstr "**Курсов проект:** създайте своето repository (раздел 12) с `library.js`, `try.js` и два или три анонимизирани примерни документа. Сложете в него своите `get`, `compareVersions`, `versionBelow` и `groupBy`, експортирайте ги и изпълнете `try.js`."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-array-methods.md:1600
msgid "Optional: take one of your rules and find every loop in it. Which could be a method? Which should stay a loop?"
msgstr "По желание: вземете едно от правилата си и намерете всеки loop в него. Кой би могъл да е метод? Кой трябва да остане loop?"

